OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of sunshine and
OL,6,Fshowers for most, these most frequent
OL,7,Fin the morning before easing from the
OL,8,Fwest. Cloud increasing from the west
OL,9,Finto the evening. Feeling a little
OL,10,Ffresher with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud thickens and lowers
OL,13,Ffrom the west with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Ffollowing, possibly locally heavy
OL,15,Fthrough the early hours. Turning
OL,16,Fbreezy and remaining mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
